    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e513b05e4bf4e7ede19deec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不去使用这份力量，反而停下脚步，那不是太可惜了吗！\n明明心已经开始迈向下一个幸福了！　所以……――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed61037aa2e4162c9d7ce915e2ba7b7d147a664cb84ec827f3dded1ffe76198",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0054/storytimeline_090054006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a519865a6ec7262bdaba07cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光钻＆防爆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccef1f9d888dc66487123bc527fbb4ebc12998809fd8c817719d38f2b355aa98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0054/storytimeline_090054006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
