      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我，要举行婚礼。虽然我也知道姐姐的心情。\n但是，也有会为我的『幸福』――而感到高兴的人在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb482f2650c792dc5875a8019d6163e21a90d1109373f6d4f9893b006b197457",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0054/storytimeline_090054006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16d289151ee21ab192dc288",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会场的幽灵",
